1
00:00:00,345 --> 00:00:02,975
- [WHISPERING] Sheldon?
- Shh!

2
00:00:03,974 --> 00:00:05,644
[WHISPERING]
Penny's sleeping.

3
00:00:07,978 --> 00:00:09,188
Are you insane?

4
00:00:09,354 --> 00:00:12,984
You can't break into a woman's apartment
in the middle of the night and clean.

5
00:00:13,149 --> 00:00:14,149
(Sheldon:)I had no choice.

6
00:00:14,317 --> 00:00:17,817
(Sheldon:)I couldn't sleep knowing that just
outside my bedroom was our living room...

7
00:00:17,988 --> 00:00:20,278
...and outside our living room
was that hallway...

8
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:23,738
(Sheldon:)...and immediately adjacent
to that hallway was this.

9
00:00:24,995 --> 00:00:26,915
Do you realize that if Penny wakes up...

10
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:29,920
(Leonard:)...there is no reasonable explanation
as to why we're here?

11
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:32,833
(Sheldon:)I just gave you a reasonable explanation.

12
00:00:33,503 --> 00:00:35,793
(Leonard:)No, no. You gave me an explanation.

13
00:00:35,964 --> 00:00:39,304
(Leonard:)It's reasonableness will be determined
by a jury of your peers.

14
00:00:39,926 --> 00:00:42,766
(Sheldon:)Don't be ridiculous. I have no peers.

15
00:00:42,929 --> 00:00:44,809
(Leonard:)Sheldon, we have to get out of here.

16
00:00:44,973 --> 00:00:46,853
[PENNY SNORING]

17
00:00:48,143 --> 00:00:51,023
(Sheldon:)You might want to speak
in a lower register.

